# This is a placeholder file
# To create the actual icon:
# 1. Take the icon.svg file
# 2. Convert it to PNG at 192x192 and 512x512 sizes
# 3. Save them as icon-192x192.png and icon-512x512.png
# 4. You can use online tools like https://favicon.io/favicon-converter/
# 5. Or use ImageMagick: convert icon.svg -resize 512x512 icon-512x512.png
